+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/claims/{claimId}/split — split an amount (more than 0.00 and less than the claim's amount)
+# off an OPEN claim: the claim keeps the rest, unbound from any statement figure, and a new OPEN claim of the same person
+# with the split-off amount, date and note, the sheet's next number, opened by the user and with its due-by fixed now
+# from the terms in force on its date, records the original's number as split-from. A claim that is not OPEN, a
+# deferred one, one dated inside a closed period, an amount out of range (or not a number with up to two decimals), or
+# a user whose role may not open a claim, is a 409 and a claim not on the sheet a 404, neither writing anything.
+# Responds 201 with the new claim as stored.
